  "name": "Coffee, Caramel and Tahini Cupcakes",
  "subtitle": "Spiced coffee cupcakes with caramel and sesame frosting",
  "description": "Tender coffee-date cupcakes are finished with caramel and a smooth tahini buttercream.",
